namespace Wakeel.Admin.UI.Services.Organisation;

/// <summary>
/// The letter template the tool falls back on when no organisation template has been uploaded
/// (AGREEMENT item 57). It is the owner's own official form, carried inside the tool rather than
/// read off the disk, so a fresh installation can write a letter on the day it is set up and no
/// folder outside the tool has to survive for it to keep working.
/// </summary>
/// <remarks>
/// The bytes below are the Word file itself. Nothing generates this at build time: a template is
/// a fixed document, and keeping it as a literal means the tool has exactly one copy of it and no
/// build step can quietly change what a letter looks like.
/// </remarks>
